<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $82-15/16 IN WALL ST.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $82-15/16 IN WALL ST.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up $3-4/16 at $82-15/16 in New York on Wednesday and then retreated slightly to $82-1/4.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 430.20 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
